<svg width="100%" viewBox="0 0 680 420" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="" xmlns:c2pa="http://c2pa.org/manifest"><metadata><c2pa:manifest></c2pa:manifest></metadata><title style="fill:rgb(0, 0, 0);stroke:none;color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:start;dominant-baseline:auto">Deep learning for natural language processing</title><desc style="fill:rgb(0, 0, 0);stroke:none;color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:anthropic-sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:start;dominant-baseline:auto">A pipeline showing text tokens turned into embedding vectors, processed by a transformer with self-attention, then used for translation, sentiment, question answering and summarization.</desc>
